URNITURE.**<br/>39. 🏆 **A TOOL RESULT IS ALSO A HYPOTHESIS. CROSS-CHECK IT WITH YOUR EYES.**<br/>   *(Claude's grep said the data was clean — it had 7786 breaks. His probe said the search was<br/>   broken — he was reading the wrong field. **BOTH WRONG. LOOK AT THE ACTUAL LINE.**)*<br/>40. 🏆 **`|| []` DOES NOT CATCH AN UNDECLARED NAME. IT THROWS — and an async throw does not<br/>   crash, it VANISHES, and the spinner spins forever.** *(MF77.)*<br/>41. 🏆 **A MATCH OF 2-OF-4 IS NOT A MATCH. IT IS A COINCIDENCE. THE THRESHOLD IS THE FEATURE.**<br/>   *(At 2-of-4, mince+potato returns a GREEK SALAD. At 3-of-4: Cottage Pie. Measured.)*<br/>42. 🏆 **THE RATCHET — EVERY BUG YOU CLOSE ADDS A CHECK TO THE DOCTOR. THE DOCTOR ONLY<br/>   GROWS. You cannot find all the bugs. You CAN make sure none comes back twice.**<br/>43. 🆕 🏆 **A MODEL MAY NOT BEND A DISH TO FIT THE FRIDGE.**<br/>   **A BOBOTIE HAS NO POTATO IN IT — NOT EVEN IF SHE HAS A POTATO.**<br/><br/>📌 **PUSH RULE: '1 changed file' → PUSH. '0 changed files' → NOTHING TO PUSH. The screen never lies.**<br/>📌 **STANDING: Node `fs.writeFileSync`, NEVER Python · core.js = 4149 — count before and after.**"]
